      "contextFingerprint": "4930af022e6dabf6b5dd288de0ffcc30f52cba389d6c0d5ccc89d52809f759bf",
      "sourceText": "| 方面 | const | constexpr |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| 含义 | 变量不可修改 | 变量或函数可在编译期求值 |\n| 初始化 | 可在运行时初始化 | 必须在编译期初始化 |\n| 函数 | 只能修饰成员函数 | 函数可在编译期执行 |\n| 用途 | 防止变量被修改 | 编译期计算，提高效率 |\n| 示例 | `const int x = get_value();` | `constexpr int x = 5 * 3;` |",
      "translatedText": "| Aspect | const | constexpr |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| Meaning | Variable cannot be modified | Variable or function can be evaluated at compile time |\n| Initialization | Can be initialized at runtime | Must be initialized at compile time |\n| Function | Can only modify member functions | Function can be executed at compile time |\n| Purpose | Prevent variables from being modified | Compile\\-time computation, improve efficiency |\n| Example | `const int x = get_value();` | `constexpr int x = 5 * 3;` |",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 190,
        "outputTokens": 82,
        "costUsd": 0.000156
      }
